{
  "bridge_text": "既然你好奇这棵树里藏着什么，那我们这就走进树干深处，看看那个穿着背心的狐狸正等着谁呢。",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜站在那棵高大的空心树前，寒风吹动着她的红大衣。她决定不再理会大人们的叮嘱，深吸一口气，拨开了遮挡树洞的藤蔓。那阵微弱的嗡嗡声变得清晰起来，像是某种古老的歌谣在邀请她进入黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "走进树干，她发现了一条盘旋向下的楼梯。在最高的那一级台阶上，坐着一只穿着补丁绿背心的老灰狐狸，他就是莫斯克。他用像枯叶摩擦般的嗓音告诉莉娜，这棵树不是用来参观的，让她赶紧回家，忘掉那阵嗡嗡声。可莉娜摇了摇头，坚定地说，她还没听够这树里的故事，怎么能就此离开呢。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The fox guards his secrets as closely as he guards the tree, but his grumpy expression hides a story all its own. Let us see what happens when Lina offers him a small, red peace offering.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her eyes bright with curiosity despite the fox's stern warning. She knew that some melodies were worth a little trouble, and Mosk’s gruff words only made her wonder more about the song hidden deep within the wood."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, but Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and said, this is for the trouble of walking me down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "Mosk, the fox with the green vest, stood there quite still as if he were made of stone. With that secret kept safe, we watch to see if Lina can convince him to let her pass.",
  "resume_strategy": "skip",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed toward the exit, his eyes fixed on the shadows. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and whispered that it was for the trouble of walking her down. Mosk stared at the fruit for a long time, his whiskers twitching. Finally, he stood up, straightened his patched vest, and stepped onto the first stair without saying a word."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
